    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t02-practice-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t02-practice-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看矩形ABCD：AB=30、AD=BC=50。△ABE以AB为底、到E的高为50，面积750。它被AF分成△ABF与阴影△AEF，后者300，所以△ABF面积450。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两小三角形共用底AF，B、E到竖直AF的距离分别是AB=30与ED，所以450：300=30：ED，得到ED=20。整个梯形面积=矩形1500+左侧三角形500=2000。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "ED=30\\times\\frac{300}{450}=20,\\quad S_{\\text{水仙}}=30\\times50+\\frac12\\times20\\times50-300=1700"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "水仙花占去掉阴影后的部分，面积2000−300=1700平方米，我们选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
